        </ids:property>
        <ids:property instructions="4ab58c80d1c511e1800000215ad4efdf : ThermalTransmittance || Thermal transmittance coefficient (U-Value) of the element. It is the total thermal transmittance coefficient through the building element proxy within the direction of the thermal flow (including all materials).&#10;&#10;Note: new property in IFC4" datatype="IFCTHERMALTRANSMITTANCEMEASURE" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
