        <ids:property instructions="7e57dd00d1ec11e1800000215ad4efdf : ArticleNumber || Article number or reference that is be applied to a configured product according to a standard scheme for article number definition as defined by the manufacturer. It is often used as the purchasing number." datatype="IFCIDENTIFIER" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
