        <ids:property instructions="d86e9780d21811e1800000215ad4efdf : ThermalTransmittance || Thermal transmittance coefficient (U-Value) of a material.&#10;It applies to the total door construction." datatype="IFCTHERMALTRANSMITTANCEMEASURE" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
